flowchart TB
  A[Find an artist's post] --> B[Apply in a private message]
  B --> C{Artist accepted you?}
  C -->|No| D[Wait or try elsewhere]
  C -->|Yes| E[Pay as agreed]
  E --> F{Continue?}
  F -->|Canceled payment| E
  F -->|Paid| G[Wait for delivery]
  G --> H[Review what they send]
  H --> I[They ask for your sign-off]
  I --> J{Accept result?}
  J -->|No| K[Request revisions]
  K --> G
  J -->|Yes| L[Approve and finish]
